# Popular video games, 1990–2020 — the Games Catalogue bench's dataset.
# One row per release: annual series (FIFA, Madden, NBA 2K, PES, Need for Speed, Call of Duty,
# Assassin's Creed, Just Dance, F1) get a row each year, as a real catalogue has them.
# sales: approximate lifetime units in millions, all platforms, as commonly reported — a bench's
# figures, not a source; blank where free-to-play or not reported. score: Metacritic, where one
# exists; blank before 1996 and for titles never scored. Absence is deliberate — a sort has to say
# what it does with it. platform: the lead platform at release. type: the genre, one per game.
